WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.219
Hospitality means helping people

2
00:00:02.259 --> 00:00:04.586
feel welcome, safe and comfortable.

3
00:00:05.536 --> 00:00:06.526
Say hello in a way

4
00:00:06.566 --> 00:00:07.846
that works for you.

5
00:00:08.796 --> 00:00:10.260
Ask, How can I help?

6
00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.521
Then give the guest time to respond.

7
00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:14.218
A kind welcome

8
00:00:14.258 --> 00:00:15.662
can make a difference.

